<title>GREECE: DIARY OF PROSPECTIVE SHAREHOLDER MEETINGS.</title>
<headline>DIARY OF PROSPECTIVE SHAREHOLDER MEETINGS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a schedule of</p>
<p>forthcoming shareholder meetings.</p>
<p>It is updated as new meetings are announced.</p>
<p>COMPANY		   DATE     TIME     VENUE</p>
<p>Fanco		July 09   16:00   Handris Hotel</p>
<p>* Convertible bond</p>
<p>Michaniki	 July 10   15:00   Company HQ</p>
<p>							 Meg. Alexandrou 19</p>
<p>* Repeat AGM, bonus issue			Marousi</p>
<p>Bank/Cen.Greece July 11   11:00   Kifisias &amp; Neapoleos</p>
<p>* Repeat AGM for preferred shareholders    Marousi</p>
<p>Bank of Athens  July 11   12:00   Company HQ</p>
<p>* Repeat AGM, rights issue		     Santaroza 5</p>
<p>European Rel.   July 12   12:30   Company HQ</p>
<p>							 Kifisias Ave 274</p>
<p>* Repeat AGM for preferred shareholders    Halandri</p>
<p>DANE Sea Line		July 13   09:00   Ethnikon Theatre</p>
<p>* Repeat AGM, bonus issue			Rhodes</p>
<p>NIBID	     July 15   13:00   Megaro Mela</p>
<p>* Share conversion				 Eolou 93</p>
<p>Elviemek	  July 16   10:00   Company HQ</p>
<p>							 Kifisias 32</p>
<p>* Rights issue				     Marousi</p>
<p>Ergas	     July 16   14:00   Acropole Hotel</p>
<p>* Bonus issue</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
